# Elixir NX

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:nx, "~> 0.9.2"},
  {:exla, "~> 0.9.2"},
  {:axon, "~> 0.7.0"},
  {:kino, "~> 0.15.3"}
])
```

## 简单的模型

定义输入层

```elixir
input = Axon.input("data")
```

```elixir
template = Nx.template({2, 8}, :f32)
Axon.Display.as_graph(input, template)
```

定义模型，模型包括输入，中间层（dense），激活函数，结果层，损失函数

```elixir
model =
  Axon.input("data")
  # |> Axon.dense(32, activation: :relu)
  |> Axon.activation(:relu)
  |> Axon.dropout(rate: 0.5)
  |> Axon.dense(1)
  |> Axon.activation(:softmax)

template = Nx.template({2, 16}, :f32)
Axon.Display.as_graph(model, template)
```

```elixir
{init_fn, predict_fn} = Axon.build(model)
```

```elixir
params = init_fn.(template, %{})
```

```elixir

```

## Pure Axon model

```elixir
model = 
  Axon.input("input")
|> Axon.dense(32)
|> Axon.activation(:relu)
|> Axon.dropout(rate: 0.5)
|> Axon.dense(1)
|> Axon.activation(:softmax)
```

```elixir
{init_fn, predict_fn}=
  Axon.build(model, debug: true, print_values: true)
```

```elixir
  params = init_fn.(Nx.template({2,16}, :f32), %{})
```

```elixir
predict_fn.(params, Nx.iota({2,16}, type: :f32))
```

## 观察梯度消失

```elixir
input = Axon.input("input")
```



<!-- livebook:{"break_markdown":true} -->

Display.as_graph的格式是operation_layer, dense_0代表layer0的dense，sigmoid_0代表layer0的sigmoid，这样我们就可以知道layer0执行了什么操作，但是在定义的时候，我们只调用了一次Axon.dense(input, 20, activation: :sigmoid)

```elixir
# 10 layer, dense 20,  activation is sigmod
defmodule Tidu do
  def layer(input, 1) do
    Axon.dense(input, 20, activation: :sigmoid)
  end
  def layer(input, n_layer) do
    layer(Axon.dense(input, 20, activation: :sigmoid), n_layer-1)
  end
end

model = Tidu.layer(input, 10)
template = Nx.template({2, 20}, :f32)
Axon.Display.as_graph(model, template)
```

```elixir
loop = Axon.Loop.trainer(model, :mean_squared_error, :sgd)
```

```elixir
train_data =
  Stream.repeatedly(fn ->
    {xs, _next_key} =
      :random.uniform(9999)
      |> Nx.Random.key()
      |> Nx.Random.normal(shape: {8, 1})

    ys = Nx.sin(xs)
    {xs, ys}
  end)
```

```elixir
Enum.take(train_data,2)
```

```elixir
Axon.Loop.run(loop, train_data, %{}, epochs: 2, iterations: 2, debug: true)
```
